"max\", \"group_by\": \"column to aggregate data (optional)\", \"category\": "
"\"The category where the field will be shown in the frontend summary section "
"(optional)\", \"chartType\": \"One of: bar, donut, stacked, column, area, "
"highlight (optional)\", \"hasDecimal\": false}\n"
"            <br>The \"method\" field is optional and defaults to \"sum\". "
"The \"hasDecimal\" field is optional and defaults to false.\n"
"        "
